@startuml
title TRT Uvicorn Server - UML Sequence Diagram

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor Operator
participant "n8n workflow\nor API client" as Client
participant "Uvicorn\ntrt_core.api:app" as API
participant "Intent normalizer" as Normalizer
participant "Patch validator/apply" as Patch
participant "Release manager" as Release
participant "TRTRepository\nJSON store" as Repo
participant "Supervisor" as Supervisor
participant "Scenario generator" as Scenario
participant "Digital twin adapter" as Adapter
participant "Host runner service" as HostRunner
participant "Isaac Sim UR5 script" as Isaac
database "Run result SQLite" as RunDB
participant "Evidence extractor" as Evidence

Operator -> Client : submit operator intent
Client -> API : GET /intent/context
API -> Repo : load current TRT and schemas
Repo --> API : current TRT context
API --> Client : valid lines, vocabularies, schemas

Client -> API : POST /intent/normalize\n(domain candidate)
API -> Normalizer : normalize_domain_candidate()
Normalizer -> Repo : read current TRT
Repo --> Normalizer : current TRT
Normalizer --> API : Intent Patch candidate
API --> Client : normalized patch

Client -> API : POST /patch/validate
API -> Patch : validate_intent_patch()
Patch -> Repo : load current TRT
Patch --> API : validation results
API --> Client : REVIEWED or NEEDS_REVISION

Operator -> Client : approve release
Client -> API : POST /release/prepare
API -> Release : prepare_release()
Release -> Repo : persist pending release
Repo --> Release : release_id
Release --> API : pending release record
API --> Client : PENDING_OPERATOR_DECISION

Client -> API : POST /release/decision APPROVE
API -> Release : record_release_decision()
Release -> Patch : apply_intent_patch()
Patch -> Repo : write new TRT version
Patch -> Repo : write audit bundle
Repo --> Patch : version and audit ids
Release --> API : RELEASED
API --> Client : release_id, audit_id, trt_version

Client -> API : POST /supervisor/reconcile
API -> Supervisor : reconcile_current_trt()
Supervisor -> Repo : load released TRT and state records
Repo --> Supervisor : TRT + current state
Supervisor -> Repo : save reconciliation plan
Supervisor --> API : READY / WAITING / DEGRADED / REJECTED
API --> Client : reconciliation plan

alt plan is READY or DEGRADED
  Client -> API : POST /scenario/generate
  API -> Scenario : generate_scenario_spec()
  Scenario -> Repo : load TRT, plan, templates, line registry
  Scenario -> Repo : write ScenarioSpec JSON
  Scenario --> API : scenario_spec_id and path
  API --> Client : GENERATED

  Client -> API : POST /simulation/runs\nASYNC
  API -> Adapter : build_isaac_command()
  Adapter -> Repo : resolve host/container paths
  Adapter --> API : host runner payload
  API -> HostRunner : POST /isaac/runs
  HostRunner -> Isaac : start pick_up_example.py subprocess
  HostRunner --> API : run_id, status STARTED
  API --> Client : poll_url

  loop until terminal
    Client -> API : GET /simulation/runs/{run_id}
    API -> HostRunner : GET /isaac/runs/{run_id}
    HostRunner --> API : RUNNING or terminal status
    API --> Client : current run status
  end

  Isaac -> RunDB : write simulation_runs,\nline_kpis, tool_events
  Client -> API : POST /evidence/summarize
  API -> Evidence : build_evidence_summary()
  Evidence -> RunDB : read KPI/result tables
  Evidence -> Repo : load ScenarioSpec and TRT context
  Evidence -> Repo : write evidence summary/audit data
  Evidence --> API : operator and technical findings
  API --> Client : evidence summary
else plan waits or is rejected
  API --> Client : stop before ScenarioSpec or simulation
end

Operator <- Client : final summary and next action

@enduml
